{
  "_comment": [
    "What a creature is: its spawn category, which vanilla states and which survives offline, and its tags,",
    "which vanilla maintains and which do not. #undead and #arthropod are the two this saves us hand-writing.",
    "",
    "`mobs` is on every category, and that is what makes it the whole population: `spawns` derives from",
    "every entity type but MISC, and MobCategory has exactly these seven others — so a word striking #mobs",
    "strikes every creature the Art can reach, with no list to keep in step as mobs are added.",
    "Overridden per member by art/preset_tags/spawns.json."
  ],
